			<li class="item-1 odd first ">
				<h3 title="Just Announced">
					<a href='http://www.ea.com/news/e3-press-conference-to-be-broadcast-on-spike-tv'><span>Just Announced</span></a></h3> 
				<a href="http://www.ea.com/news/e3-press-conference-to-be-broadcast-on-spike-tv"><span><img alt="Spike_TV_tout_292x164.jpg" class="thumb" src="http://web-vassets.ea.com/Assets/Richmedia/Image/Promotions/Spike_TV_tout_292x164.jpg?ver=575_en_US" height="164" width="292"/></span></a> 
				<h4 title="EA Press Conference On SpikeTV"> 
					<a href="http://www.ea.com/news/e3-press-conference-to-be-broadcast-on-spike-tv"><span>EA Press Conference On SpikeTV</span></a></h4> 
				<p>Spike TV is the exclusive live broadcast home for EA’s E3 press conference. Tune in on June 6 to see the first live demos of Battlefield 3, Mass Effect 3 and more.</p> 
			</li> 
							
							
			<li class="item-2 even  ">
				<h3 title="Now Available">
					<a href='http://www.ea.com/news/shift-2-unleashed-speedhunters-dlc'><span>Now Available</span></a></h3> 
				<a href="http://www.ea.com/news/shift-2-unleashed-speedhunters-dlc"><span><img alt="shift2-unleashed-tile.jpg" class="thumb" src="http://web-vassets.ea.com/Assets/Richmedia/Image/Billboard/shift2-unleashed-tile.jpg?ver=575_en_US" height="165" width="292"/></span></a> 
				<h4 title="Shift 2 Speedhunters Content Pack"> 
					<a href="http://www.ea.com/news/shift-2-unleashed-speedhunters-dlc"><span>Shift 2 Speedhunters Content Pack</span></a></h4> 
				<p>Prepare to dial up the intensity of the driver’s battle with the Speedhunters content pack. Now available on Xbox Live and the PlayStation Network.</p> 
			</li> 
							
							
			<li class="item-3 odd  last">
				<h3 title="Today's EA Store Deal">
					<a href='http://www.eastore.ea.com/generations?intcmp=generations_EAcom_HPPromo_0511'><span>Today's EA Store Deal</span></a></h3> 
				<a href="http://www.eastore.ea.com/generations?intcmp=generations_EAcom_HPPromo_0511"><span><img alt="Sims3_Generations_preorder_292x164.jpg" class="thumb" src="http://web-vassets.ea.com/Assets/Richmedia/Image/Promotions/Sims3_Generations_preorder_292x164.jpg?ver=575_en_US" height="164" width="292"/></span></a> 
				<h4 title="Sims 3 Generations Pre-Order Promotion"> 
					<a href="http://www.eastore.ea.com/generations?intcmp=generations_EAcom_HPPromo_0511"><span>Sims 3 Generations Pre-Order Promotion</span></a></h4> 
				<p>For a limited time only, when you pre-order The Sims 3 Generations, you'll get a free copy of The Sims 3 Outdoor Living Stuff Pack and free shipping!</p> 
			</li> 
							
